      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah hi you can talk faster with me i'm in a hurry",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. What's going on with your heat or cooling?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "nothing's broken i just need the yearly furnace tune up booked uh sometime early morning next week would be good",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, a tune-up. What's the address?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "it's 31 05 ditmars blvd queens one one one oh five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "We cover that area. I don't have an account at that address, so I'll set it up as a new visit. Who should the technician ask for, and is someone home for the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "marcus hale uh i'm the one who'll be there so you can just call me and yeah somebody'll be home it's my place",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, Marcus. Is the number I'm calling from the best one to reach you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah this one's fine it's nine two nine five five five oh one one five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, that's 929-555-0115. Let me check the early morning times next week. I have early morning openings tomorrow, Friday and Saturday, all 8 to 12. Which day works for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "uh the first one tomorrow morning whatever's open at eight that works",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Tomorrow, Tuesday, is 8 to 12. Before I book, I need one more detail: what's the furnace's rough age and brand, if you know it?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "uh i don't know the brand offhand and i'm not sure how old it is it's been in the building a while that's all i know",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "No problem. Anything the tech should know when they get there, like a gate code, a buzzer or a dog?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no gate no dog just ring the buzzer for 31 05 and i'll let them in uh tell them the furnace is in the basement",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, ring the buzzer and the furnace is in the basement. Let me read back the details. Let me read that back: your home at 31-05 Ditmars Blvd, Queens, 11105, and the best number is 929, 555, 0115. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's right look go ahead and book it for tomorrow morning the eight o'clock if you've got it",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "You're all set for tomorrow, Tuesday, with the technician arriving between 8 and 12. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "nope that's everything thanks bye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, Marcus. Stay warm out there.",
          "said": null
        }
